    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "ERA Downey McCarthy Auctioneers are very pleased to present to the market this ideal two bedroom terraced property, which occupies a convenient location close to all amenities including Wilton shopping centre, Cork University Hospital / CUMH and more. \r\n\r\nAccommodation consists of reception hallway, open plan kitchen/dining/living area and main bathroom on the ground floor whilst upstairs the property offers two bedrooms."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "There is no private yard or garden, there is a communal garden space for residents."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Reception Hallway - 2.5m x 1.05m \r\nA solid door allows access into the reception hallway. The reception hallway has  access to a storage press that houses the gas boiler, access to the electrical board, one centre light fitting, one radiator and tile flooring.  A door allows access into the bathroom.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 3.03m x 0.89m \r\nThe bathroom has one frosted window overlooking the front of the property, a three piece suite with a built-in shower cubicle incorporating a Mira Elite SE electric shower, tile flooring, one radiator and one centre light fitting. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining/Living Room - 4.71m x 3.83m \r\nThe open plan kitchen/dining/living area has one large window overlooking the front of the property, carpet flooring, space for a couch and dining table, access to under stair storage, and a gas fire. The kitchen features fitted units at eye and floor level, worktop counter, tile splashback, breakfast bar, integrated oven/hob/extractor fan, plumbing for a washing machine, and a stainless steel sink. \r\n\r\nStairs and Landing - 2.22m x 1.91m \r\nThe stairs and landing are fitted with carpet flooring throughout. The area has one centre light fitting, and an access hatch to the attic.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.74m x 2.33m \r\nThis double bedroom has one window overlooking the front of the property, built-in wardrobes for storage, one centre light fitting, one radiator and laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.58m x 1.94m \r\nThis single bedroom has one window overlooking the side of the property, attractive neutral décor, access to storage, centre light fitting, radiator and laminate flooring.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Approx. 45.6 Sq. M. / 491 Sq. Ft. \r\nBuilt in the 1980's approx.\r\nBER C3 - BER No. 104881693\r\nTwo bedrooms upstairs\r\nOff street parking \r\nLocated close to the South Ring Road, N40 network\r\nClose to CUH, CUMH, MTU, UCC, & Wilton Shopping Centre\r\nLocated on main bus routes to Cork city centre\r\nProperty was rented out previously / Landlord served notice on the tenants \r\nRent was set on the 23/10/24 at €1,080 per month\r\nProperty is now being sold with the benefit of vacant possession"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C3"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Please see Eircode T12 E4EX for directions."
      },
